WEBVTT

00:00:00.547 --> 00:00:05.096
Welcome to GM Tools Hub: your digital workspace, without limits.

00:00:05.146 --> 00:00:10.803
Smart tools, productivity resources and creative experiences, all in one place.

00:00:12.411 --> 00:00:21.489
Everything begins with a clean menu: Home, Free Tools and Gadgets, AI and Productivity, Kids Corner, Portfolio, About and Contact.

00:00:21.539 --> 00:00:27.632
Open AI and Productivity to find the Smart Assistant, Career Studio, Coding Academy and more.

00:00:29.007 --> 00:00:33.120
Press Control K, anywhere on the site, to search everything at once.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:37.306
Type a word, like tola, and the best matches appear instantly.

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:40.250
Prefer a darker look?

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:45.391
The new day and night switch changes the whole site in one tap, and remembers your choice.

00:00:47.505 --> 00:00:50.840
Free Tools and Gadgets brings sixty-five tools together.

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:56.040
Search them, filter by category, save your favourites, and jump back to recent tools.

00:00:56.090 --> 00:01:03.551
PDF and image converters, calculators, career tools and more, with no sign-up, and your files stay in your browser.

00:01:05.868 --> 00:01:08.802
There are new tools for everyday life in Pakistan.

00:01:08.852 --> 00:01:18.967
Convert tola, masha and ratti to grams and see the value of your gold, work out plot sizes in marla and kanal, and check your electricity bill appliance by appliance.

00:01:19.017 --> 00:01:23.966
You can also write amounts in words for cheques, and calculate Matric marks and fuel costs.

00:01:26.868 --> 00:01:34.424
The Pakistan Salary Tax Calculator shows your monthly tax and take-home pay, using the twenty twenty-six to twenty-seven slabs.

00:01:36.868 --> 00:01:43.858
Plan your day with Tasks and Planner, practise coding in the Developer Playground, and prepare your resume in Career Studio.

00:01:43.908 --> 00:01:46.263
All free, and private by design.

00:01:47.872 --> 00:01:54.225
Kids Corner is a safe, ad-free place to draw, colour and play, with Mango, the talking cat.

00:01:54.275 --> 00:01:57.822
There are no accounts, no chat, and nothing is recorded.

00:01:59.872 --> 00:02:03.902
GM Tools Hub: free, private, and built to be useful.

00:02:03.952 --> 00:02:05.081
Open it today.
